            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.15.1

- Text in the full screen player is easier to read over bright album art.
- Better VoiceOver support, including seeking with the progress bar.
- Respects Reduce Motion and Increase Contrast.
- New shortcuts: Command with the arrow keys changes track and volume.
]]></description>
